{"id":"n39943-1-2","stage":5,"title":"내심 · 内心","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n39943-1-2-1","ko":"지수는 너무 차가워.","zh":"智秀也太冷淡了吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수는","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"지수는","audio":"/audio/9ca6ce32d0646be4023e.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수는","audio":"/audio/9ca6ce32d0646be4023e.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太。","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"차가워.","meaning":"冷淡，冰冷，冷漠","explanation":"차갑다：冷淡，冰冷，冷漠；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"차갑다","audio":"/audio/489db26a6bdebee8cbe3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71730","senseId":"2","lemma":"차갑다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"차가워","audio":"/audio/28f35ae3167cae1582b0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"489db26a6bdebee8","term":"차갑다","zh":"冷淡，冰冷，冷漠","audio":"/audio/489db26a6bdebee8cbe3.mp3","entryId":"71730","definition":"性格不温和或态度不热情，非常冷冰冰。","pronunciation":["차갑따"]}],"audio":"/audio/85b65f4e03bd8ff61a7c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n39943-1-2-2","ko":"겉으로만 그렇지 내심은 한없이 따뜻한 사람이야.","zh":"她只是表面那样，其实是个无比温暖的人啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"겉으로만","meaning":"外表，表面","explanation":"겉：外表，表面；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"겉","audio":"/audio/190590ebae043637dc00.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31329","senseId":"2","lemma":"겉","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"겉으로만","audio":"/audio/20db96120d10a4991f45.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇지","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇지","audio":"/audio/66da57bd505cc1e1c679.mp3"}},{"text":"내심은","meaning":"内心","explanation":"내심：内心；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"내심","audio":"/audio/679d7431067f7db56ffd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"39943","senseId":"1","lemma":"내심","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내심은","audio":"/audio/a87cf396a19894d52158.mp3"}},{"text":"한없이","meaning":"无比，无限地，无止境地","explanation":"한없이：无比，无限地，无止境地。","readings":[{"term":"한없이","audio":"/audio/44254f9a2af7b4d5b62c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85582","senseId":"1","lemma":"한없이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한없이","audio":"/audio/44254f9a2af7b4d5b62c.mp3"}},{"text":"따뜻한","meaning":"温暖，热情","explanation":"따뜻하다：温暖，热情；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"따뜻하다","audio":"/audio/e4840ad0903352f1e2e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57297","senseId":"2","lemma":"따뜻하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"따뜻한","audio":"/audio/69677f0d1e9358738e58.mp3"}},{"text":"사람이야.","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람이야","audio":"/audio/8ba3193df6d48d1842b5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"190590ebae043637","term":"겉","zh":"外表，表面","audio":"/audio/190590ebae043637dc00.mp3","entryId":"31329","definition":"指显现在外的样子或现象。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"679d7431067f7db5","term":"내심","zh":"内心","audio":"/audio/679d7431067f7db56ffd.mp3","entryId":"39943","definition":"外表不显露出来的真实心思。","pronunciation":["내ː심"]},{"id":"44254f9a2af7b4d5","term":"한없이","zh":"无比，无限地，无止境地","audio":"/audio/44254f9a2af7b4d5b62c.mp3","entryId":"85582","definition":"没有尽头地。","pronunciation":["하ː넙씨"]},{"id":"e4840ad0903352f1","term":"따뜻하다","zh":"温暖，热情","audio":"/audio/e4840ad0903352f1e2e3.mp3","entryId":"57297","definition":"心肠、感情、态度、气氛等亲切平和。","pronunciation":["따뜨타다"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]}],"audio":"/audio/c3b34c0619cfa90fcee1.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.183,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=39943","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":152,"sequenceScore":3.0097,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["她只是表面那样，其实是个无比温暖的人啊。","前面什么都看不见啊。","智秀也太冷淡了吧。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["她只是表面那样，其实是个无比温暖的人啊。","智秀也太冷淡了吧。","前面什么都看不见啊。"],"answer":0}]}
